{"schema_version":1,"paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","questions":[{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510-q01","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201510-q01","number":"1","order":1,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"ed356180cd9c8ab717a95a2f0246628bfec33389b45bee3552c323982675cf81","body":[{"type":"text","value":"kg和s是国际单位制两个基本单位的符号，这两个基本单位对应的物理量是(  )"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 质量和时间"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 质量和位移"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 重力和时间"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 重力和位移"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】国际单位制中，基本单位只有七个，高中阶段只需掌握6个，即kg、m、s、A、mol、K，各自对应的物理量是质量、长度、时间、电流强度、物质的量、热力学温度。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510-q02","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201510-q02","number":"2","order":2,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"16879016c02f00240fe08c09ce68382bbb3602c7c9a5b4fedc36527acad7242b","body":[{"type":"text","value":"下列v-t图象中，表示物体做匀速直线运动的是(  )\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a1412652a410e6ba84e712f6b039cf3ee73ee837144b7b2d2a1398d5dfd7197b.png","width":455,"height":116,"width_mm":120.39,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201510-q02-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 图 A"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 图 B"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 图 C"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 图 D"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】在v-t图象中，斜率代表的是加速度，D的斜率为0，即为匀速直线运动。A的斜率为负，为匀减速直线运动，B、C的斜率为正，B为初速度不为0的匀加速直线运动，C为初速度为0的匀加速直线运动。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510-q03","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201510-q03","number":"3","order":3,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"f189f88a90df1c1eee14702947d2c71962d0768b7c6478118bb0f92d5d7adb22","body":[{"type":"text","value":"2015年9月3日，纪念中国人民抗日战争暨世界反法西斯战争胜利70周年阅兵式在天安门广场举行。如图所示，七架战机保持“固定队列”在天安门广场上空飞过。下列说法正确的是(  )\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ae31ca911754f92c8d644a851d2e99acb96a6336de4ff7b7b5a1eee00e2c8aae.png","width":157,"height":117,"width_mm":41.59,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201510-q03-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 以某飞机为参考系，其他飞机是静止的"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 以飞行员为参考系，广场上的观众是静止的"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 以某飞行员为参考系，其他飞行员是运动的"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 以广场上的观众为参考系，飞机是竖直向上运动的"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】参考系是假定为不动的物体，因此，固定队列中的飞机(或飞机中的人)为参考系时，队列中的其他飞机和其他飞行员是静止的，广场上的观众是运动的；以广场上的人作为参考系时，飞机是水平运动的，故A正确。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510-q04","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201510-q04","number":"4","order":4,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"f0f763144ecf65028c37106846357ba3fef7490d7f6d4e09360a767e10b05dd9","body":[{"type":"text","value":"小李乘坐高铁，当他所在的车厢刚要进隧道时，看到车厢内显示屏上的示数为216 km/h，他立即观察手表秒针走动，经过20 s车厢出了隧道，则该隧道的长度约为(  )\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1c19e1aa82c4da6ca8db82405f58cb1b35e89ae6ec6b805bc0b354894b4d4793.png","width":172,"height":109,"width_mm":45.51,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201510-q04-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 600 m"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 1 200 m"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 2 160 m"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 4 320 m"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】v=216 km/h=60 m/s，x=vt=1 200 m，B正确。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510-q05","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201510-q05","number":"5","order":5,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"b279ed30af057f8231c9ab23f0c8b4b9cdac99a0a7893878236f350e508453a4","body":[{"type":"text","value":"画作《瀑布》如图所示。有人对此画作了如下解读：水流从高处倾泻而下，推动水轮机发电，又顺着水渠流动，回到瀑布上方，然后再次倾泻而下，如此自动地周而复始。这一解读违背了(  )\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/17b66efec244bc50d3bc2ef8a83f7baedded7b5edaa2b489416ee32cb51a51c9.png","width":136,"height":140,"width_mm":35.88,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201510-q05-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 库仑定律"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 欧姆定律"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 电荷守恒定律"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 能量守恒定律"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】水流的重力势能一部分转化成水轮机的能量，另一部分会转化成内能，回到瀑布上方的水流一定会越来越少，题目中描述的周而复始是不成立的，违背了能量守恒定律，故D正确。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510-q06","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201510-q06","number":"6","order":6,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"a9c18ad70a03fb852162db40a55dd4d40a17701cd192c4e3494a0e31092d83a2","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图所示，一女同学穿着轮滑鞋以一定的速度俯身“滑入”静止汽车的车底，她用15 s穿越了20辆汽车底部后“滑出”，位移为58 m。假设她的运动可视为匀变速直线运动，从上述数据可以确定(  )\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b1c77116b8ae20ea52c19535d1511e288d7c83f167a84bb6819fcdde959edc72.png","width":193,"height":136,"width_mm":51.06,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201510-q06-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 她在车底运动时的加速度"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 她在车底运动时的平均速度"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 她刚“滑入”车底时的速度"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 她刚“滑出”车底时的速度"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】已知位移为x=58 m，用时t=15 s，则可求出平均速度v="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{58}{15}"},{"type":"text","value":" m/s"},{"type":"math","value":"\\approx"},{"type":"text","value":"3.87 m/s，只有位移和时间这两个物理量，在匀变速直线运动中是无法求出初速度、末速度和加速度的，故B正确。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510-q07","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201510-q07","number":"7","order":7,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"926a98be5e464b1f65b741ca2b03308e4891ab49c6ff99b2b66455fb055a31ba","body":[{"type":"text","value":"2015年9月20日“长征六号”火箭搭载20颗小卫星成功发射。在多星分离时，小卫星分别在高度不同的三层轨道被依次释放。假设释放后的小卫星均做匀速圆周运动，则下列说法正确的是(  )\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b32b9f4e88f9950e873b1bd1c0bdc140e9ded50bca54635945f26af555b61f0e.png","width":117,"height":162,"width_mm":30.96,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201510-q07-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 20颗小卫星的轨道半径均相同"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 20颗小卫星的线速度大小均相同"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 同一圆轨道上的小卫星的周期均相同"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 不同圆轨道上的小卫星的角速度均相同"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】小卫星分别在不同的三层轨道上做匀速圆周运动，即它们的轨道半径不同，A错误；由G"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Mm}{r^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"=m"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"得v="},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{\\frac{GM}{r}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，随着轨道半径的增大，卫星的线速度减小，B错误；由G"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Mm}{r^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"=m"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega"},{"type":"math","value":"{}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"r得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{\\frac{GM}{r^{3}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，随着轨道半径的增大，卫星的角速度减小，D错误；由G"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Mm}{r^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"=m"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{4\\pi ^{2}}{T^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"r得T=2"},{"type":"math","value":"\\pi"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{\\frac{r^{3}}{GM}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，随着轨道半径的增大，卫星的运行周期变大，半径相同，则周期相同，故C正确。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510-q08","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201510-q08","number":"8","order":8,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"bdc6fe79b932b0376467a42aad28802c76af6e1c24ff9b3c4fcd06d313133a89","body":[{"type":"text","value":"本卷可能用到的相关参数：重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g"},{"type":"text","value":" 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10\\text{ m/s}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n质量为30 kg的小孩坐在秋千板上，秋千板离系绳子的横梁的距离是2.5 m。小孩的父亲将秋千板从最低点拉起1.25 m高度后由静止释放，小孩沿圆弧运动至最低点时，她对秋千板的压力约为(  )"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 0"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 200 N"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 600 N"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 1 000 N"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】小孩子从最高点运动到最低点，由机械能守恒定律可得mgh="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"m"},{"type":"math","value":"v^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，h=1.25 m，由牛顿第二定律可得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"-mg=m"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"，R=2.5 m，解以上两式得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"=600 N，再由牛顿第三定律可知，小孩对秋千板的压力为600 N。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510-q09","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201510-q09","number":"9","order":9,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"fb3c83f54a7422f450b00cddac00dd55b72c27a396874ee5ea7758ba1e51f3ba","body":[{"type":"text","value":"小张在探究磁场对电流作用的实验中，将直导线换作导体板，如图所示，发现在a、b两点之间存在电压"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{ab}"},{"type":"text","value":"。进一步实验结果如下表：\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ea8202eebe2b69bf89524097bcd69a0d5cd092ede694129fa341f2ec3de6c748.png","width":242,"height":127,"width_mm":64.14,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201510-q09-row1"},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"text","value":"电流"}],[{"type":"text","value":"磁感应强度"}],[{"type":"text","value":"电压"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{ab}"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"I"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B"}],[{"type":"text","value":"U"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"I"}],[{"type":"text","value":"2B"}],[{"type":"text","value":"2U"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"I"}],[{"type":"text","value":"3B"}],[{"type":"text","value":"3U"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"2I"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B"}],[{"type":"text","value":"2U"}]],[[{"type":"text","value":"3I"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B"}],[{"type":"text","value":"3U"}]]]},{"type":"text","value":"\n由表中结果可知电压"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{ab}"},{"type":"text","value":"(  )"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 与电流无关"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 与磁感应强度无关"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 与电流可能成正比"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 与磁感应强度可能成反比"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】由第1，2，3组数据可知，电流保持不变时，磁感应强度增大多少倍，电压"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{ab}"},{"type":"text","value":"也增大多少倍，可推知电压"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{ab}"},{"type":"text","value":"可能与磁感应强度成正比，B、D错误；由第1，4，5组数据可知，磁感应强度保持不变时，电流增大多少倍，电压"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{ab}"},{"type":"text","value":"也增大多少倍，可推知电压"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{ab}"},{"type":"text","value":"可能与电流成正比，A错误，C正确。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510-q10","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201510-q10","number":"10","order":10,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e030911e578d87f0cab38b8969a2dee10685ef9a92946c16b23931f35b1e7fe0","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图所示是我国某10兆瓦(1兆瓦="},{"type":"math","value":"10^{6}"},{"type":"text","value":" W)光伏发电站，投入使用后每年可减少排放近万吨二氧化碳。已知该地区每年能正常发电的时间约为1 200 h，则该电站年发电量约为(  )\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/587007f4bb33d52b24b5ac1e8c3ef58afd5e92191e6bc135cbd1ceb4c39ef4fb.png","width":176,"height":120,"width_mm":46.65,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201510-q10-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 1.2×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{6}"},{"type":"text","value":"kW·h"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 1.2×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{7}"},{"type":"text","value":"kW·h"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 1.2×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{9}"},{"type":"text","value":"kW·h"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 1.2×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{10}"},{"type":"text","value":"kW·h"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】W=Pt="},{"type":"math","value":"10^{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" kW×1 200 h=1.2×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{7}"},{"type":"text","value":" kW·h，故B正确。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510-q11","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201510-q11","number":"11","order":11,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"83267b9cac7ca66ca712c1a03df2423ef0457103c410e1f6de8e3726e8711110","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图所示，一质量为m、电荷量为Q的小球A系在长为l的绝缘轻绳下端，另一电荷量也为Q的小球B位于悬挂点的正下方(A、B均视为点电荷)，轻绳与竖直方向成30°角，小球A、B静止于同一高度。已知重力加速度为g，静电力常量为k，则两球间的静电力为(  )\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d710169b75327c51e6a8be56a13fabc8ec1ecded10567df459f0239f0fea2982.png","width":108,"height":114,"width_mm":28.57,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201510-q11-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{4kQ^{2}}{l^{2}}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{kQ^{2}}{l^{2}}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. mg"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"mg"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】由库仑定律得F=k"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{Q^{2}}{(lsin \\theta )^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{4kQ^{2}}{l^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，A正确，B错误；对A小球受力分析如图所示。由共点力平衡知，tan "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{F}{mg}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得F="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"mg，故C、D错误。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510-q12","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201510-q12","number":"12","order":12,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"0190a94d5f804a92c0062bfc16cc7debfc7703ff56759eaaa2f7fe185d4b7ea9","body":[{"type":"text","value":"快艇在运动中受到的阻力与速度平方成正比(即"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{f}"},{"type":"text","value":"=k"},{"type":"math","value":"v^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":")。若油箱中有20 L燃油，当快艇以10 m/s匀速行驶时，还能行驶40 km，假设快艇发动机的效率保持不变，则快艇以20 m/s匀速行驶时，还能行驶(  )"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 80 km"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 40 km"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 10 km"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 5 km"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】设20 L油发动机可提供的总功为W，由能量守恒定律知当快艇以10 m/s匀速行驶时，W="},{"type":"math","value":"F_{f}"},{"type":"math","value":"s_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"=kv"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"math","value":"s_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，当快艇以20 m/s匀速行驶时，W="},{"type":"math","value":"F_{f}"},{"type":"math","value":"s_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"=kv"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{2}^{2}"},{"type":"math","value":"s_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，可得"},{"type":"math","value":"s_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"=10 km，C正确。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510-q13","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201510-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"0611f42df6ddc11c7252a6a74e3cb24e99a53f8e5a00b020adc43704747cbbc1","body":[{"type":"text","value":"本卷可能用到的相关参数：重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g"},{"type":"text","value":" 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10\\text{ m/s}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n将质量为1.0 kg的木块放在水平长木板上，用力沿水平方向拉木块，拉力从0开始逐渐增大，木块先静止后相对木板运动。用力传感器采集木块受到的拉力和摩擦力的大小，并用计算机绘制出摩擦力大小"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{f}"},{"type":"text","value":"随拉力大小F变化的图象，如图所示。木块与长木板间的动摩擦因数为(  )\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/955b5360cf3a8ae5e12a5314d484dd3e3f224ec118059f7b0820efcf40279800.png","width":160,"height":96,"width_mm":42.39,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201510-q13-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 0.3"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 0.5"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 0.6"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 1.0"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】由图象可知，当拉力大于等于5 N时木块开始滑动，可得最大静摩擦力大小为5 N，此后拉力F继续增大，木块受到的滑动摩擦力"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{f}"},{"type":"text","value":"保持3 N不变，由"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{f}"},{"type":"text","value":"=μmg，解得μ=0.3，A正确。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510-q14","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201510-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"多选题","topics":["近代物理","光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"9d1fe1b538b1f460f5