"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"=72 km/h。\n(1)求从发现刹车失灵至到达“避险车道”这一过程汽车动能的变化量；\n(2)求汽车在下坡过程中所受的阻力；\n(3)若“避险车道”与水平面间的夹角为17°，汽车在“避险车道”受到的阻力是在下坡公路上的3倍，求汽车在“避险车道”上运动的最大位移(sin 17°"},{"type":"math","value":"\\approx"},{"type":"text","value":"0.3)。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/28d7f129b45e9aedb756fdef959bd55e93cc86cdcd868f4146d006a2e315441e.png","width":264,"height":135,"width_mm":69.85,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201510-q20-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1)3.0×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{5}"},{"type":"text","value":" J (2)2×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" N (3)33.3 m\n【详解】(1)由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{k}"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"mv"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{2}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"-"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"mv"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{k}"},{"type":"text","value":"=3.0×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{5}"},{"type":"text","value":" J\n(2)由动能定理有mgh-"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{f}"},{"type":"text","value":"l="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"mv"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{2}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"-"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"mv"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{f}"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}mv_{1}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{2}^{2}+mgh}{l}"},{"type":"text","value":"=2×"},{"type":"math","value":"10^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" N\n(3)设向上运动的最大位移是l'，\n由动能定理有-(mgsin 17°+3"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{f}"},{"type":"text","value":")l'=0-"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"mv"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{2}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n得l'="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{mv_{2}^{2}}{2(mg\\sin 17^{\\circ}+3F_{f})}"},{"type":"text","value":"=33.3 m"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510-q21","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201510-q21","number":"21","order":21,"type":"实验题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"f78f9fedcb9e6734032009386f621b2efe89f36ad7d44bb2ddf5ba03fd2f35a3","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【加试题】(1)在“探究变压器线圈两端的电压与匝数的关系”实验中，电源输出端与变压器线圈连接方式正确的是（填空）(填“图甲”或“图乙”)。变压器原、副线圈的匝数分别为120匝和60匝，测得的电压分别为8.2 V和3.6 V，据此可知电压比与匝数比不相等，主要原因是（填空）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a77c778a89186cf099146d3eaf1a08f7a4b44c04a299f5d05a33d1d8acd07abc.png","width":522,"height":160,"width_mm":138.11,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201510-q21-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(2)在“探究导体电阻与其影响因素的关系”实验中，某同学测量金属丝直径时，螺旋测微器示数如图丙所示，读数是（填空）mm；若要测量该金属丝的电阻率，还需要用到的测量仪器有（填空）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1e099dcdeb6812246ff5f5ef3d653fed2ff9c54c12271e302191499c08f21a2a.png","width":384,"height":155,"width_mm":101.6,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-201510-q21-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图丙"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1)图乙 漏磁、铁芯发热，导线发热 (2)0.638±0.002 电压表、电流表、刻度尺\n【详解】(1)“探究变压器线圈两端的电压与匝数的关系”实验中的输入电流只能是交流电，因图甲接在直流上，图乙接在交流上，故图乙正确。理想变压器的原、副线圈两端的电压比等于原、副线圈的匝数比，即"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{U_{1}}{U_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"="},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{n_{1}}{n_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，实际生活中的变压器存在漏磁、线圈电阻大，铁芯发热等现象，导致实验时测得的电压比与匝数比不相等。\n(2)螺旋测微器的固定刻度读数为0.5 mm，可动刻度读数为13.8×0.01 mm，故螺旋测微器的读数为0.5 mm+13.8×0.01 mm=0.638 mm。\n测量金属丝的电阻率的实验原理是部分电路欧姆定律，需要用到电压表和电流表测量金属丝两端的电压和流过金属丝的电流，根据电阻定律R="},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{l}{S}"},{"type":"text","value":"，还需要利用刻度尺测量金属丝的长度。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510-q22","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-201510","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-201510-q22","number":"22","order":22,"type":"